{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12114030","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12114030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1211403001:1":{"text":"이봐! 다들 괜찮아?","source_cn":"喂！你们几个没事吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F04CEA739AEAB8C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1211403002:1":{"text":"신밧드! 여긴 어떻게 왔어?","source_cn":"辛巴达！你怎么过来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78A4E7C6A1501910","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211403003:0":{"text":"난 마법을 할 줄 모르니 헤엄쳐 왔지!","source_cn":"我又不会魔法，当然是游过来的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF0F93D3768003B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211403004:0":{"text":"이 멍청아! 너무 위험하잖아!","source_cn":"你这蠢货！太冒险了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDDE48EFE2E1A7AF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211403005:0":{"text":"그럼 나더러 저 멀리서 너희가 목숨을 내던지는 걸 보고만 있으라는 거야? 난 못 해.","source_cn":"难道要我远远看着你们拼命？我可做不到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0B164D1A86BA73","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1211403006:1":{"text":"넌 뒤에서 우